# ============================================================
# USER FEATURES API TESTING GUIDE
# Orders | Reviews | Addresses
# Base URL: http://localhost:7410/api/user
# ============================================================

# ----- STEP 1: Login and paste your token below -----
@baseUrl     = http://localhost:7410/api/user
@token       = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

# ----- REAL IDs (fill after each step) -----
@productId   = 6a2a94996044d5a7ba8916af
@addressId   = PASTE_ADDRESS_ID_HERE
@orderId     = 6a2b8fbe63fbfebb5d327d5c
@reviewId    = PASTE_REVIEW_ID_HERE


# ============================================================
# AUTH — Get your token first
# ============================================================

### Register (skip if already registered)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login — copy token from response into @token above
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Logout (Client-Side Only)
# Note: Since the backend uses stateless JWT authentication, there is no server-side 
# logout API. To log a user out, simply delete the JWT token from the frontend's 
# local storage or secure storage.

###

### Verify OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobileNumber": "9876543210",
  "otp": "1234"
}

###

### Resend OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobileNumber": "9876543210"
}

###

### Get Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###


# ============================================================
# 1. ADDRESS MANAGEMENT
# ============================================================

### 1.1 Add Home Address (copy _id → paste into @addressId above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/addresses/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Rahul Shah",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "addressLine1": "123 Main Street",
  "addressLine2": "Near City Mall",
  "city": "Surat",
  "state": "Gujarat",
  "pincode": "395001",
  "country": "India",
  "addressType": "Home",
  "isDefault": true
}

###

### 1.2 Add Work Address
POST {{baseUrl}}/addresses/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Rahul Shah",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "addressLine1": "Office Block B, Ring Road",
  "addressLine2": "",
  "city": "Surat",
  "state": "Gujarat",
  "pincode": "395002",
  "country": "India",
  "addressType": "Work",
  "isDefault": false
}

###

### 1.3 Get All Addresses
GET {{baseUrl}}/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 1.4 Get Single Address
GET {{baseUrl}}/addresses/{{addressId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 1.5 Update Address
PUT {{baseUrl}}/addresses/{{addressId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressLine2": "Beside Lemon Tree Hotel",
  "phone": "9123456789"
}

###

### 1.6 Set as Default Address
PUT {{baseUrl}}/addresses/{{addressId}}/set-default
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 1.7 Delete Address
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/addresses/{{addressId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###


# ============================================================
# 2. ORDER / CHECKOUT SYSTEM
#
# YOUR CART IS CURRENTLY EMPTY — follow steps in order:
#   ① Run 2.1  →  adds Cotton Saree to cart
#   ② Run 2.2  →  confirm cart has items
#   ③ Run 1.1  →  add address (if not done), copy _id → @addressId
#   ④ Run 2.3  →  place order, copy order._id → @orderId
#   ⑤ Run 2.8 / 2.9 / 2.10 to view / track / cancel
# ============================================================

### 2.1 ① Add Cotton Saree to Cart  ← RUN THIS FIRST
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "6a2a94996044d5a7ba8916af",
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### 2.2 ② View Cart (confirm items are added)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2.3 ③ Create Order — COD
# Requires: @addressId to be set at top (run 1.1 first)
# After success: copy "order._id" from response → paste into @orderId above
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressId": "{{addressId}}",
  "paymentMethod": "COD",
  "shippingCost": 50,
  "notes": "Please deliver before 6 PM"
}

###

### 2.4 Create Order — Online Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressId": "{{addressId}}",
  "paymentMethod": "Online",
  "shippingCost": 0,
  "notes": ""
}

###

### 2.5 Get All Orders (Order History)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2.6 Get Orders with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2.7 Filter Orders by Status
# Status: Pending | Confirmed | Processing | Shipped | Delivered | Cancelled
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2.8 Get Single Order Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2.9 Track Order (timeline view)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/track
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2.10 Cancel Order (only if status = Pending or Confirmed)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cancelReason": "Changed my mind"
}

###


# ============================================================
# 3. PRODUCT REVIEWS & RATINGS
# Note: Order must have status = "Delivered" to add a review
# ============================================================

### 3.1 Add Review — JSON (no image)
# orderId must be a DELIVERED order containing this product
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "rating": 5,
  "title": "Excellent Cotton Saree!",
  "comment": "Very happy with the quality and colour. The fabric is soft and comfortable. Will buy again."
}

###

### 3.2 Add Review with Image Upload (multipart)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="productId"

{{productId}}
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="orderId"

{{orderId}}
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="rating"

4
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Good Saree
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="comment"

Nice quality but delivery took 5 days.
------WebKitFormBoundary--

###

### 3.3 Get All Reviews for Cotton Saree
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/product/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3.4 Get Reviews — Paginated & Sorted
# Sort options: newest | oldest | highest | lowest | helpful
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/product/{{productId}}?page=1&limit=5&sort=highest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3.5 Get My Reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/my-reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3.6 Get My Reviews — Paginated
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/my-reviews?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3.7 Edit My Review (copy review _id → paste into @reviewId above)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 4,
  "title": "Updated: Great Saree",
  "comment": "After wearing for a month, quality is still good. Colour hasn't faded."
}

###

### 3.8 Vote Review as Helpful
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}/vote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vote": "helpful"
}

###

### 3.9 Vote Review as Not Helpful
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}/vote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vote": "not_helpful"
}

###

### 3.10 Delete My Review
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###


